  "description": "A self-contained YAML library for .NET 8, shaped after System.Text.Json and matching the sibling Bodu.Text.Toml surface: the YamlSerializer POCO mapper (converters, the full attribute family, naming policies, callbacks), the ref-struct Utf8YamlReader/Utf8YamlWriter token surface, a mutable YamlNode DOM, and a read-only YamlDocument DOM. Implements the Bodu YAML Core Tree Profile, a YAML 1.2 core-schema, JSON-compatible tree model (defaults to the 1.2 core schema with no implicit yes/no booleans; opt-in 1.1 typing): mapping keys resolve to unique scalar strings, anchors are unique and acyclic, and tabs are rejected as indentation. Supports block and flow collections, quoted and block scalars, comments, anchors and aliases, opt-in YAML 1.1 merge keys, core tags, and multi-document streams. The reader is buffered (it parses into an in-memory node store), not a single-pass streaming scanner.",
